### create
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "company": "Xero", "jobTitle": "Developer", "status": "APPLIED" }

### list all
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications

### filter by status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications?status=APPLIED

### get one
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1

### update
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "company": "Xero", "jobTitle": "Senior Developer", "status": "INTERVIEW", "cvVersion": "v2" }

### change status
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1/status?status=OFFER

### delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1

### not found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/999

### invalid body
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "company": "", "status": "APPLIED" }